{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Information.ComplexityDictionaryOptions","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Information.ComplexityDictionaryOptions","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Information.QouPNeqNp","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":13,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.sep_iff_trace_notInFP","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.sep_iff_trace_notInFP","kind":"theorem","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/ComplexityDictionaryOptions.lean#L107-L113","doc":"**The wall, made explicit (sorry-free from the hypotheses).**  With the\ncited facts *and* a `TraceFaithfulness` instance, `P ≠ NP` is equivalent to\n`J_L(q₀) ∉ FP`.  The forward direction is free (soundness); the backward\ndirection is exactly `TraceFaithfulness` — the open input. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.TraceFaithfulness.faithful","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.TraceFaithfulness.faithful","kind":"theorem","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/ComplexityDictionaryOptions.lean#L105-L105","doc":"The conjectural counting→decision transfer. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.TraceFaithfulness.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.TraceFaithfulness.mk","kind":"ctor","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/ComplexityDictionaryOptions.lean#L103-L103","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.TraceFaithfulness","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.TraceFaithfulness","kind":"class","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/ComplexityDictionaryOptions.lean#L98-L105","doc":"**FAITHFULNESS is the wall (open — no instance).**  The reverse implication\n`J_L(q₀) ∉ FP ⟹ P ≠ NP` is *not* a consequence of `CitedComplexity`\n(counting-hardness ⇏ decision-hardness).  Every dictionary option that\nreaches `P ≠ NP` amounts to supplying an instance of this class — i.e.\n*assuming* exactly the open step. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.exactTrace_notInFP","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.exactTrace_notInFP","kind":"theorem","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/ComplexityDictionaryOptions.lean#L93-L96","doc":"Equivalently: exact Jones evaluation lies outside `FP` once `P ≠ NP`\n(sorry-free). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.trace_notInFP_of_sep","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.trace_notInFP_of_sep","kind":"theorem","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/ComplexityDictionaryOptions.lean#L86-L91","doc":"**SOUNDNESS is provable (sorry-free).**  `P ≠ NP ⟹ J_L(q₀) ∉ FP`: the\nobservation trace *does* deliver counting-hardness from decision-hardness.\nThis is the direction the framework gets for free. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.CitedComplexity.toda_collapse","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.CitedComplexity.toda_collapse","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/ComplexityDictionaryOptions.lean#L84-L84","doc":"Toda / `NP ⊆ P^#P`: easy counting collapses the hierarchy, `P = NP`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.CitedComplexity.jvw_sharpP_hard","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.CitedComplexity.jvw_sharpP_hard","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/ComplexityDictionaryOptions.lean#L82-L82","doc":"Jaeger–Vertigan–Welsh: exact Jones evaluation is `#P`-hard, so a\npoly-time trace collapses `FP = #P`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.CitedComplexity.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.CitedComplexity.mk","kind":"ctor","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/ComplexityDictionaryOptions.lean#L79-L79","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.CitedComplexity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.CitedComplexity","kind":"class","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/ComplexityDictionaryOptions.lean#L76-L84","doc":"**Cited complexity facts** (no instance — established literature that\nMathlib cannot express).  JVW `#P`-hardness of the Jones value and Toda's\n`NP ⊆ P^#P`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.PeqNP","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.PeqNP","kind":"opaque","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/ComplexityDictionaryOptions.lean#L73-L74","doc":"The decision collapse `P = NP`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.FPeqSharpP","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.FPeqSharpP","kind":"opaque","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/ComplexityDictionaryOptions.lean#L70-L71","doc":"Exact counting is easy: `FP = #P`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Information.ExactTraceInFP","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Information.ExactTraceInFP","kind":"opaque","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Information/ComplexityDictionaryOptions.lean#L67-L68","doc":"The exact observation trace `J_L(q₀)` is polynomial-time computable. ","signatureChunk":0}]}